WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Every night, somewhere in your infrastructure,

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.300
a script is waiting to run.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.400
Crontabs, scattered across forgotten servers.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.300
Failures nobody sees, until morning.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.300
There is a better way.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.100
Cronomicon brings your Bash, Ansible,

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:22.400
Terraform, PowerShell and Python under one roof.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.400
Compose scripts, schedules and secrets into jobs.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.100
Then chain those jobs into workflows.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.450
Watch every run,

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.200
past and future, on a single, living score.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.550
Route jobs to isolated runners,

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.700
with secrets injected at the last moment,

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.900
and masked everywhere else.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.700
One static binary.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.400
Your definitions in Git.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.100
Your team, in control.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.800
Cronomicon.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.400
Ancient rites of scheduling, made easy.
